he could be standing outside of a boba shop with boba in hand. I would like it to be night time and for everything to look really modern with neon lights. If you could include my little dog standing next toe her as well, I would really love that!\nMy new model: https://imgur.com/a/QcH5cWR\nMy dog: https://imgur.com/a/w9mNOsl\n\nI'd really love this art in 16:9 if possible! And would like to use it on twitter and twitch.\nThank you, \nZuan", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@JagdPanda/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4e90941b/uploads/origins/27243f8c-a0f5-427d-a797-f77d9fc83f4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e6b56420de00adc80994686bd58889b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4e90941b/uploads/origins/27243f8c-a0f5-427d-a797-f77d9fc83f4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e6b56420de00adc80994686bd58889b, https://si.imgix.net/4e90941b/uploads/origins/27243f8c-a0f5-427d-a797-f77d9fc83f4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5d52106c5380320744127af6f53d1e33 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4e90941b/uploads/origins/27243f8c-a0f5-427d-a797-f77d9fc83f4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9caac30059dbe9682afc175a51646b5b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi again Jagd! \nI was actually wondering if you would like to work with me again!\nI was looking to have art done of my friend and I's FFXIV characters! I really hoping to have them be having fun and dancing together in club setting. \nMy character: https://imgur.com/a/F90QxQB\nMy friend: https://imgur.com/a/EMC1Xvk\n\nThank you as always!\nZuan", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@JagdPanda/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3c417ee3/uploads/origins/c86e5535-6cd8-4a22-97b8-1e06d7100e71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1da5037869f70ea77f7a0508dc